sequenceDiagram
    participant Worker
    participant DB
    participant Email as Resend
    Worker->>DB: Load queued job
    Worker->>Email: Send confirmation
    alt Email succeeds
        Email-->>Worker: 200
        Worker->>DB: Mark sent and close circuit
    else Email fails
        Email-->>Worker: Error
        Worker->>DB: Increment attempts and next_retry_at
        alt Attempts reach five
            Worker->>DB: Mark dead_letter
        else Attempts remain
            Worker->>DB: Leave queued for exponential backoff
        end
    end
